  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nI'd like the option to switch boards using a keyboard shortcut.  The ability to assign a shortcut on a per board basis would allow for quicker user navigation.  For example `control + shift + 1`, `control + shift + 2` etc.  At a minimum  you should be able to cycle through all boards using `control + shift + >` (next board) and `control + shift + <` (previous board)\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
